				{ type = "quest", id = 4127 },
			},
			text = [=[{link:raschal-the-courier}Raschal{/link} had meant to row down the coast and cross the south of {link:feralas}Feralas{/link}, to keep clear of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} camp. His boat was found sunk and torn, the stronghold's crest still on its side. In the mud beneath it lay his knife. Something in the water had nearly broken the boat in two.]=],
