			hint = "Learn what the courier's knife remembers.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 4130 },
			},
			text = [=[{link:quintis-jonespyre}Quintis{/link} held the knife and saw {link:raschal-the-courier}Raschal{/link} carry two packs inland, meet the Woodpaw, and come back to his boat afraid. Raschal feared nothing the gnolls could do. Something else had frightened him, badly enough that he never saw the water rising behind him. Ginro knew then that he was not searching for a body.]=],
