			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Hadoken Swiftstrider commands the defense of {link:camp-mojache}Camp Mojache{/link}. He has no patience for the question of whether the Woodpaw gnolls belong in {link:feralas}Feralas{/link}. They attack his camp, and if the {link:horde}Horde{/link} does not stand firm, it will be driven out of the region. He is a veteran who has read many battle plans, and he knows a desperate enemy when he sees one.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Hadoken was the first of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} to see that the gnolls were not the real threat. He followed their fear south and found the Zukk'ash, and his report on them reached {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He ordered the Woodpaw alphas struck down in quick succession to throw the gnolls into chaos.
• He sent searchers for the gnolls' battle plans.
