			hint = "Find the gnolls' battle plans in their southern camps.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 2903 },
			},
			text = [=[The gnolls' map told the story. Most of their arrows pointed south, away from {link:camp-mojache}Camp Mojache{/link}, and beside a drawing of a great insect were rows of tally marks: their dead. The Woodpaw were fighting a war on two fronts, and the one they were losing was not against the {link:horde}Horde{/link}.]=],
