		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[From his quiet post, Falfindel watches over more than {link:feralas}Feralas{/link}. His concern reaches into {link:the-barrens}The Barrens{/link}, where the resting place of the boar demigod Agamaggan has been corrupted, and as far north as the {link:stonetalon-mountains}Stonetalon Mountains{/link}, whose keeper has begged his help.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He studies what corrupted the resting place of Agamaggan in the southern {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}.
