• He answers the plea of {link:keeper-albagorm}Keeper Albagorm{/link} to send forest spirits to the {link:the-charred-vale}Charred Vale{/link}.
• He waits on the supplies that couriers carry across {link:feralas}Feralas{/link} from {link:feathermoon-stronghold}Feathermoon{/link}.]=],
		},
	},
